      {
        "language": "plaintext",
        "code": "## Task\n- I need **10 HIGH QUALITY topics** on **advanced prompt engineering techniques**.\n1. Do a *breadth first Tree of Thoughts Search* of the online communities top ideas and best practices. [This is to inform you on the best topics to select from.] [Be sure to check GitHub]\n2. Plan out what topics you want to use. Include enough material for the Claude Project to understand exactly what you intend for the report. Use elements from Cognitive Science to aid you in this.\n3. Review your plan for errors or roam for improved logic/reasoning.\n4. Make necessary changes to the plan.\n5. Generate the final topic list using your plan as reference.\n### Note\nThese topics are for a Claude Project that has been engineered to produce extremeley high quality educational material. [Long-form Content 6,000+ Words] so keep this in mind when you design the topics you want to use.",
        "line_start": 21,
        "line_end": 31,
        "char_count": 875,
        "line_count": 9,
        "source": "topic-set-advanced-prompt-engineering-techniques-2025122509.md"
      }
